  "summary": "RESTON, Va. , Oct. 1, 2025 /PRNewswire/ -- NVR , Inc. (NYSE: NVR) announced today that George R. Oliver has been appointed to its Board of Directors as an independent director effective October 1, 2025 . Mr. Oliver previously served as Chairman and Chief Executive Officer of Johnson Controls",
